## Summary

**Story SKY-001b: API Discovery - Verified Skyscanner RapidAPI Contract**

### What was created:
1. **`/tmp/skyscanner-app/docs/api-contract.md`** — Comprehensive API contract documentation (9.2 KB) containing:
   - **Host section:** Confirmed `skyscanner.p.rapidapi.com` via 429 rate-limit responses
