     - `GET /flights/getquotes`
     - `GET /flights/search`
     - `GET /get-quotes`
     - `GET /search`
     - `GET /api/v1/flights/getquotes`
     - `GET /api/v2/flights/search`
   - **Query Parameters:** Distinguished required (`fromPlace`, `toPlace`) from optional (`outboundDate`, `inboundDate`, `adults`, `children`, `infants`, `cabinClass`)
   - **Authentication:** Documented headers with secure placeholder `<RAPIDAPI_KEY>` (no literal values exposed)
   - **Sample Response:** Included 429 error body and inferred 2xx JSON structure mapping to FlightResult fields
